    "Description": "## Changes\r\n\r\n## 🐛 Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- fix(autodiscovery/golang): honour version filter for pseudo versions @olblak (#10695)\r\n- fix(yaml): support multiple yaml key wildcard @olblak (#10694)\r\n- fix(core): generate reportID before templating @olblak (#10664)\r\n\r\n## 🧰 Maintenance\r\n\r\n- deps(go): bump module github.com/drone/go-scm to v1.42.17 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10704)\r\n- deps(golang): Bump minor version for github.com/aws module @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10711)\r\n- chore(dockerfile): upgrade node version @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10665)\r\n- chore: scan golang CVEs @olblak (#10641)\r\n- deps: bump Updatecli GH action to v3.8.0 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10637)\r\n- deps: bump Updatecli GH action to v0.122.0 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10618)\r\n\r\n## Contributors\r\n\r\n@olblak, @updateclibot[bot], [updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) and updatecli\r\n\r\n## Sponsors\r\n\r\nIf Updatecli is useful to you, please consider sponsoring it.  \r\nYour support helps maintain and improve this project.\r\n\r\n[![GitHub stars](https://img.shields.io/github/stars/updatecli/updatecli?style=for-the-badge)](https://github.com/updatecli/updatecli/stargazers) [![Sponsor](https://img.shields.io/badge/Sponsor-%E2%9D%A4-pink?style=for-the-badge)](https://www.updatecli.io/support/#sponsor-or-donate)",
    "DescriptionHTML": "\u003ch2\u003eChanges\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e🐛 Bug Fixes\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003efix(autodiscovery/golang): honour version filter for pseudo versions \u003ca class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/olblak/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/olblak\"\u003e@olblak\u003c/a\u003e (\u003ca class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5661725841\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/updatecli/updatecli/issues/10695\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/updatecli/updatecli/pull/10695/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/updatecli/updatecli/pull/10695\"\u003e#10695\u003c/a\u003e)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003efix(yaml): support multiple yaml key wildcard \u003ca class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/olblak/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/olblak\"\u003e@olblak\u003c/a\u003e (\u003ca class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5660995844\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/updatecli/updatecli/issues/10694\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/updatecli/updatecli/pull/10694/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/updatecli/updatecli/pull/10694\"\u003e#10694\u003c/a\u003e)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003efix(core): generate reportID before templating \u003ca class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/olblak/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/olblak\"\u003e@olblak\u003c/a\u003e (\u003ca class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-err